D","duration":3203,"title":"团宠老妈又美又飒","video_desc":"温宁本是财团大小姐，却因爱情冲动与李兵结婚，婚后育有一子李明。她在婚姻中全身心付出，操持家务，甚至同时打几份工，却不知李兵早已背叛。温宁被李兵以及李兵的情人许翠欺负，想要回娘家寻求帮助时却被母亲以及三个嫂子羞辱，温宁的三个哥哥知道之后，给她撑腰，霸气护妹。温宁成功找回尊严，在哥哥们的支持下重新找回了属于自己的一切，故事落下帷幕。","series_id":"7477487087021739070","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623314643916D3DDA65088B2DC5\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7477487087021739070\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.01798621006309986,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7202730178833008,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.05853288993239403,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.07832605391740799,\\\"like\\\":0.04336579516530037,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.7613868117332458,\\\"collect\\\":0.026759283617138863}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7477487087021739070","play_cnt":996,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"广州千墨文化传媒有限公司","sub_title":"成长·女性成长","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":36,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5010,\"name\":\"成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5010&categoryName=成长&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5045,\"name\":\"女性成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5045&categoryName=女性成长&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5049,\"name\":\"婚姻经营\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5049&categoryName=婚姻经营&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5107,\"name\":\"自我救赎\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5107&categoryName=自我救赎&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5188,\"name\":\"追妻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5188&categoryName=追妻&genreType=13